              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "CLAIMED: the shortest separation at which the 1/r^2 law has been tested is 3217314099569684239182554733009 Planck lengths, exactly — 52 micrometres over 1.616255 x 10^-35 m, with a remainder of 538705 in units of 10^-41 m. Extra dimensions are excluded above that separation and untouched below it."
                }
              ]
