              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "CLAIMED: the CMB tension bound of 1.5 x 10^-7 sits below the 10^-6 that GUT-scale Nambu-Goto strings would carry, so that band is excluded — 15 against 100 in units of 10^-8. Lighter strings remain untouched, because the theory sets no floor."
